 Apsey","x":"As you know, our regulatory rate construct is a pass-through of all of our O&M expense and given the economic impact, certainly the impact of that may have on our customers and ratepayers, we took early action to significantly curtail our O&M spending for the benefit of our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/fortis-inc-fts-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2020 Q3","e":"fts","d":"2020-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Linda Apsey","x":"And, as you know, that's just a straight pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/fortis-inc-fts-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2020 Q4","e":"fts","d":"2021-02-14","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jocelyn H. Perry","x":"And lastly, in November, the AUC issued a decision on the Alberta Independent System Operator tariff application, resulting in FortisAlberta retaining approximately CAD400 million in transmission-related investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/15/fortis-inc-fts-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2020 Q4","e":"fts","d":"2021-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David G. Hutchens","x":"There's things that we're looking for from FERC in order to streamline things like planning and siting that I mentioned on the National Corridor Conversation, looking at how we better manage queues within the RTOs for interconnecting renewables.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/15/fortis-inc-fts-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2021 Q1","e":"fts","d":"2021-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jocelyn H. Perry","x":"This is expected to encourage large regional projects, while the newly proposed Department of Energy Grid Development Authority should streamline, permitting and planning of regional and intra-regional transmission investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/fortis-inc-fts-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2021 Q2","e":"fts","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David G. Hutchens","x":"And in order -- and the costs associated with the small amount of RTO adders that get passed through to customers are dwarfed in comparison to the savings and the benefits that those same customers get by having that RTO there, having the coordination of transmission planning, development, et…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/fortis-inc-fts-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2021 Q2","e":"fts","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jocelyn H. Perry","x":"But so far, we are seeing some positive pricing and investors are wanting us to do this.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/fortis-inc-fts-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2021 Q3","e":"fts","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David G. Hutchens","x":"Due to the length of our planning cycle and the long-term nature of our capital plan, the recent price increases for commodities such as steel and copper are not fully reflected in our five year plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/fortis-inc-fts-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2021 Q3","e":"fts","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David G. Hutchens","x":"So if those projects have higher costs, then those costs would be built into that capital and would end up getting passed through as higher costs and capital costs, etc. on a going forward basis to customers through rates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/fortis-inc-fts-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2021 Q3","e":"fts","d":"2021-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"David G. Hutchens","x":"And we wanted to make sure that we were reaffirming the guidance that we had put out there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/fortis-inc-fts-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2021 Q4","e":"fts","d":"2022-02-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Hutchens","x":"But still, there's customers who want to have, like me myself at my home in Arizona have 100% renewable energy tariff where my energy comes 100% from renewables, and we have that, obviously, for across the board in Arizona.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/fortis-inc-fts-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2021 Q4","e":"fts","d":"2022-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Hutchens","x":"And depending on which jurisdiction we're talking about across our footprint, some of those have very direct pass-through mechanisms to customers like ITC and now TEP's transmission down in Arizona has that same pass-through mechanism.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/fortis-inc-fts-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2022 Q1","e":"fts","d":"2022-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Hutchens","x":"We don't really have much of an impact yet on the tariff issue on both TEP and our smaller subsidiary, UNS Electric, and Arizona put out RFPs last month.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/fortis-inc-fts-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2022 Q1","e":"fts","d":"2022-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"David Quezada","x":"…if you can provide any color on what you're looking to procure over that period and if the Department of Commerce investigation into solar panels from Southeast Asia, I mean, related tariffs there could cause you to juggle any kind of -- type of projects between wind and solar in that area?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/fortis-inc-fts-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTS 2022 Q1","e":"fts","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Hutchens","x":"We do k